    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "23c9463e25ca1b8dff367b5aa35c4dad",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-log-likelihood-for-n-observations\">1.  Log-Likelihood for <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n||)</marimo-tex> Observations</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Likelihood:</span>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\mathcal{L}(\\mu, \\sigma) = \\prod_{i=1}^{n}\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma^2}}\n\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{(x_i - \\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">Log-likelihood:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">$$\n\\ell(\\mu, \\sigma) = -\\frac{n}{2}\\log(2\\pi) - n\\log\\sigma</span>\n<ul>\n<li>\\frac{1}{2\\sigma<sup>2}\\sum_{i=1}</sup>{n}(x_i - \\mu)^2\n$$</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "c2cad3943c9d1e91d4567101707798e2",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "error",
          "ename": "exception",
          "evalue": "An ancestor raised an exception (ModuleNotFoundError): ",
          "traceback": null
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "cf5d12896ad9d141fd6f3e25a639092d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"2-gradient-wrt-mu-score-equation\">2.  Gradient w.r.t. <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\mu||)</marimo-tex> \u2014 Score Equation</h2>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\frac{\\partial \\ell}{\\partial \\mu}\n= \\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_i - \\mu) = 0\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\hat{\\mu}_{\\text{MLE}} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\n||]</marimo-tex></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
