    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "11399ffb13fef50c8906b6a6123657b4",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-gradient-wrt-sigma-score-equation\">3.  Gradient w.r.t. <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\sigma||)</marimo-tex> \u2014 Score Equation</h2>\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[\n\\frac{\\partial \\ell}{\\partial \\sigma}\n= -\\frac{n}{\\sigma} + \\frac{1}{\\sigma^3}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_i - \\mu)^2 = 0\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\hat{\\sigma}^2_{\\text{MLE}} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_i - \\hat{\\mu})^2\n||]</marimo-tex><span class=\"paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f The MLE of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\sigma^2||)</marimo-tex> is <strong>biased</strong>. The unbiased estimator uses <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(n-1||)</marimo-tex>:\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\hat{\\sigma}^2_{\\text{unbiased}} = \\frac{1}{n-1}\\sum(x_i - \\bar{x})^2||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
